      "content": "but you said \"insurmountable hurdle\" for federal restrictions... that sounds like you're saying they're basically dead on arrival. if the 'history and tradition' test from Bruen is the only thing that matters now, doesn't that pretty much invalidate any modern argument for regulation?",
